  "description": "'Cherry' is forced to go on a trip to Paris following a travel app due to her sister's threats. In a completely new place, he encounters his very familiar rival, 'Lemon'. \n\n'Cherry' tries to ignore 'Lemon', which makes him angry, and accidentally meets his partner 'Peach', and is drawn to 'Peach' who perfectly matches her ideal type... \n\nThe three become partners at the same time due to an error in the travel app of 'Lemon', 'Cherry', and 'Peach' as ​​if they interfered with the love of 'Cherry'! \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
